            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "You surge with ancestral power, temporarily embodying all the strengths of both elvenkind and humankind simultaneously, and transforming into a paragon of both races, something greater than "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "elf",
              "relationship_id": "spell.paragon-surge:uses_definition:race.elf"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "human",
              "relationship_id": "spell.paragon-surge:uses_definition:race.human"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " alone. Unlike with most polymorph effects, your basic form does not change, so you keep all extraordinary and "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "supernatural",
              "relationship_id": "spell.paragon-surge:uses_definition:special-ability.supernatural"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " abilities of your half-elven form as well as all of your gear."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "node_type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "For the duration of the spell, you receive a +2 "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "enhancement bonus",
              "relationship_id": "spell.paragon-surge:uses_definition:bonus.enhancement"
            },
            {
