              "value": " to "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "Dexterity",
              "relationship_id": "spell.paragon-surge:uses_definition:ability-score.dexterity"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " and "
            },
            {
              "node_type": "entity_link",
              "value": "Intelligence",
              "relationship_id": "spell.paragon-surge:uses_definition:ability-score.intelligence"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " and are treated as if you possessed any one feat for which you meet the prerequisites, chosen when you cast this spell. The first time each day that you cast this spell, you must select a feat and make all the associated choices that come with it. Once that choice is made, it is set for the day and additional castings must make the exact same decisions."
